    "body": "PR #1341's supplied-world reader learns relation/role correspondence, but its submitted continuation table starts correct, uses a label-derived feature, and its restore check depends on host-loop locals. This revision fits continuation from independently observed declared entity type, uses a serialized action phase for actual remaining-work execution, binds snapshots, and corrects H4 identity semantics and the evidence claims.\n\nThe original 128/128 primary outputs are independently reconstructed and retained. The original H4 test matched central -1, a fixed-offset correspondence equivalent to a categorical mapping; corrected identity matching does not establish geometric superiority. Original final worlds were repeatedly exposed. Score coefficients remain explicitly fixed. Supplied triples, entity registry, follow convention and one-token labels remain scoped.\n\nChanges include model/frame version2, exact origin descriptor checks, orphan-entity absence handling, complete read/all-arm events, saved actual checkpoints and interleaved execution. Independent original and corrected audits, resource receipts, front doors and the canonical roadmap are synchronized. The next complete milestone is observed-text, variable-depth memory answers through the same reusable session, with learned source/query roles and complete phrase emission.\n\nValidation: six focused library and two actual session-runner tests pass, offline build/fmt/claim checks pass, four JSON documents parse and 1,009 relative links resolve. The final independent audit verifies 896 arm/request rows, 2,944 transitions, 128 actual checkpoints and all 134 sealed files. Primary/category/cyclic retain 128/128, observed-type policy fits 64/128 to 128/128, and three same-request development cases give 3/3 versus fitted fixed-depth 2/3. Full evidence is linked in docs/evidence/relational-session-principal-checks-2026-09-21.json and relational-session-corrected-replay-audit-2026-09-21.json. Original reports and executable, the owner checkout and unique artifacts are preserved. No fresh-final, general-language, complete-path D0-b or energy qualification is claimed. Compatibility CI acknowledgements are not local test results.\n\nReferences #820, #973, #1139, #962, #963, #964.\n",
